Package: agentgraph
Title: Graph-Based Agentic AI Framework for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Developer", email = "dev@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Build agentic AI applications using LLM APIs with a graph-based
    orchestration engine written in C++. Define agents, tools, and workflows
    in R while the C++ engine handles concurrent execution, state management,
    tool calling, and streaming. Supports OpenAI-compatible APIs, Anthropic,
    and local LLMs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: C++20, libcurl
Imports:
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.12),
    jsonlite,
    processx
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    httpuv,
    bench,
    mirai,
    curl,
    shiny
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
